    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Craft banners the world can stand beneath.</em></p><p>As an <strong>action</strong>, you can raise a physical or symbolic <strong>standard</strong> you forged or sanctified (banner, emblem, patchwork flag, welded sign).</p><ul><li>Until the start of your next turn, allies of your choice within <strong>3 squares</strong> of you gain a <strong>+1 bonus</strong> to defense check against being <strong>Shaken</strong>.</li><li>The standard’s presence lingers in memory. If this scene ends in a clear victory or successful stand where your banner was visibly part of the moment, your faction gains <strong>+1 Unity/Victory Point</strong> (GM’s discretion, once per scene).</li></ul><p><em>People don’t just see cloth. They see permission to keep breathing.</em></p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
